{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16side_level_act16side_03_end","groupId":"act16side","stageId":"act16side_03","title":"混血兒","storyCode":"GA-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"dd0d23c7894ca61cfaf285a1e26960420b8f095b6e4e7a8f79294475dba58e25","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"“即使會被公證所開除，我也要試一試。帶塞茜莉亞去安魂教堂。至少讓她說聲再見。”","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g9_laterano_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們想跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒這麼簡單！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愉快的小販","speakerId":"avg_npc_364_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的小販","speakerId":"avg_npc_362_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃......我掩護你，快逃！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個佩洛竟然幫薩卡茲擋下攻擊......兩個，都別想跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾，你待在這兒，不許......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不許輕舉妄動。我明白，菲亞梅塔小姐。終端我打開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請相信我，我想確保的只有塞茜莉亞的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我改主意了。你不能留在這裡。現在，立刻送塞茜莉亞前往大教堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們就這麼留在大街上......更危險。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，塞茜莉亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？我們剛才不是向著聖像走的嗎，聖像在那邊，艾澤爾哥哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們繞一下路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繞路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在要去的地方應該是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安魂教堂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g11_laterano_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們跑不掉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愉快的小販","speakerId":"avg_npc_364_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她追得好快......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的小販","speakerId":"avg_npc_362_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦怎麼辦，根本甩不掉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愉快的小販","speakerId":"avg_npc_364_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情因我而起......這個黎博利不可能放過我們的，你們走！我來殿後！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的小販","speakerId":"avg_npc_362_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愉快的小販","speakerId":"avg_npc_364_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"退後。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安，多，恩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別想再逃走......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我滾出來！！！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g4_laterano_cathedralliving"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真不明白，教宗閣下為什麼對那幫“迷途者”如此......放任自流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提馬，你能告訴我嗎，既然你們認識？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不想和你談這個話題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這麼記仇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟那時候我沒死在那傢伙手上，卻差點被你殺了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很難忘的經歷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你在我面前一直戴著帽子的原因？不難受嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都做了這麼久萬國信使了。戴帽子而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和你，多一事不如少一事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在埋怨我嗎，莫斯提馬？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭始終有拉特蘭要維護的東西，也總有人要在乎這些事。我無所謂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提馬，你可能稍微有些誤解。很少有墮天使留在教廷，並不是因為教廷如何，而是因為那些墮天的薩科塔本身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的態度也許是有一點特別......莫斯提馬，你以為自己就不是個怪胎嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這麼和我說話，就不怕我變成你口中那種“正常的墮天使”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你會，就聽不到我和你“這麼說話”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧。說點實在的，什麼時候把菲亞梅塔調走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總是跟著我，對她沒好處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這句話你不和她本人說嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說過了，沒用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說就有用嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據我的觀察，權力的方便之處就是可以無視他人的意願。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無視他人的意願是要付出代價的......你為什麼想調走菲亞梅塔，說來聽聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亞梅塔說是我的護衛，你們就不好奇我有什麼需要她護衛的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，也有人覺得她是我這個墮天使的監視者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼想的人恐怕對菲亞梅塔沒有絲毫瞭解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不過是菲亞梅塔的餌，用來釣安多恩的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她要是聽見你這麼說，恐怕不會很開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那我換個說法......餌是我背上這對鎖與匙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以？讓菲亞梅塔遂願有什麼不好嗎？如果她能幹掉安多恩，或者把他緝拿回大教堂，我當然樂見其成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，你們倆加一塊也捉不到安多恩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒不至於。只要安多恩還惦記著鎖與匙，他就逃不掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過......我在想啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果安多恩已經找到別的路了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想見到的是，我走出來了，蕾繆安走出來了，甚至安多恩都走出來了......菲亞梅塔卻還陷在八年前那個雨夜裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒法和菲亞梅塔說這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是這種時候，我會稍微懷念一下共感的好處......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，忘了菲亞梅塔是黎博利。那當我沒說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是年輕的話題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，您要給我一點“過來人的教誨”嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你允許我享受一下這種屬於長輩的小小特權。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還記得八年前你對我說的話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......雖然我很不想破壞這麼溫情脈脈的氣氛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，閣下，真忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的是，“不......我還有要做的事，要保護的人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......聽薇爾麗芙學我說話也太惡寒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彼時彼刻，你不願讓我替你做選擇，此時此刻，你又何必要替菲亞梅塔做選擇呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人的路總要自己去找，自己去選，自己去走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇爾，這也是給你的回答。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g5_laterano_chapelout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......快到了，塞茜莉亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，艾澤爾哥哥，我走得太慢了......太陽都快要落山了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亞很了不起！畢竟沒辦法用公共交通......我們都走到移動地塊以外啦。要是我有菲亞梅塔小姐的身手和力氣，你也不用這麼辛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係的！其實媽媽也帶我出來過，我們會走到離家很遠的地方......和這裡也差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，菲亞梅塔姐姐不會發現我們偷偷來這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她只是查看終端的定位信號......希望我的花招至少能爭取一點時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好在還是抵達了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽就是來了這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......塞茜莉亞，我想了很久應該怎麼和你解釋這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費莉亞......你的媽媽，確實來了這裡，但她也不在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒辦法讓你再見到媽媽。但在這裡，你至少可以和她告別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾哥哥......你說的......我不太明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果媽媽來了這裡，又不在這裡，那她是......又去了別的地方嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去了哪裡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們先進去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g6_laterano_chapelin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......父親去世之前，一直希望他的葬禮上只有歡笑，不要有淚水，可我卻......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_369_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，令尊真正希望的是，您不因他的離去陷入無法自拔的悲傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_369_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哭泣也好，歡笑也好，如果那就是您的道別......想必他都會欣然接受的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你......修士小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫和的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_369_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我陪您去外面的花田走走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾哥哥，那個姐姐說她的父親也“去世”了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......去世的人，就會來到這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活著的人，在這裡與他們道別......然後，帶著對去世之人的思念，繼續自己的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那去世的人呢，他們做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也許會在天上看著我們吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為去了天上，所以再也見不到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亞，給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......媽媽的守護銃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的爸爸媽媽，都是公證所的執行者。小時候我很少能見到他們......是爺爺把我帶大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爺爺很喜歡他的銃，每次擦銃的時候，都會和我講起他年輕時的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他參加過的戰役，他的戰友，他怎麼遇到奶奶，還有我爸爸小時候的糗事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到爺爺的銃，我就會想起他講的那些故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......後來，爺爺去世了。我那時也只比你現在大一點點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公證所的執行者，帶走了他的守護銃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你母親的守護銃，本應被我帶走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"艾澤爾緩緩蹲下，將費莉亞的銃放在塞茜莉亞手中。\n塞茜莉亞低下頭，看著手中母親的守護銃。\n艾澤爾輕輕握住塞茜莉亞的手。\n溫熱的水滴跌落在守護銃的浮雕花紋上，流到年幼女孩的掌心，堆積成一小片水漬。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾哥哥......我怎麼哭了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我按爺爺教我的，每周給後院的盆栽澆水，後來它們開花了，我很高興，喊爺爺來看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喊出聲才想起來，爺爺已經不在了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再也見不到爺爺，再也沒見過他的銃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死亡就是永不再會的離別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而離別本身即是對死亡的克服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"存者在此，去者在彼，才有“離別”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“離別”是生者對逝者的惦念，也因此成為逝者存在的證明。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是為何我們需要道別。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
